  "text_md": "![](<b7d405094e779c1318d2e43b1fc897991989fb06_page_1_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\n## GREATER GOOD INTERNSHIP FUND - APPLICATION FORM\n\nThis form must be e-mailed with all other required documents to Megan Boris (mtboris@iu.edu) no later than 5pm on Friday, April 20th, 2018. Put GREATER GOOD INTERNSHIP FUND in the subject line. Applications with incomplete information or missing documents will not be considered.\n\n# Contact Information\n\nName Local Address City State Zip Phone ( ) E-mail Student ID (10-digit) #\n\n# Academic Standing\n\nClass Degree Major(s) Minor(s) # of Credits Completed Graduation Date (Mo/Yr)\n\n# Reference\n\nList the name, telephone number and e-mail for the faculty member who will be writing a letter of reference for you: Name Phone ( ) E-mail\n\n# Internship Details\n\nOrganization Internship Start date End date Location Supervisor Name Phone ( ) E-mail\n\nI confirm that information on this form is correct and accurate. SIGNATURE DATE\n\nSPEA Career Development Office 812-855-9639 speacare@indiana.edu 1315 E. 10th St. Bloomington, IN 47405 Room 200\n\n",
